command:
/* SR2E — hotbar slot 1. The −10 pass. The most-pressed key in SR2 combat.
   See docs/MACROS.md for the VIA macro-pad layout. */
// SR2E initiative passes: acting again costs 10 Initiative and play jumps to
// the highest remaining total (SR2E p.85). SR2ECombat#nextTurn implements it.
if (!game.combat) return ui.notifications.warn("No active combat.");
await game.combat.nextTurn();
